The cars might not know what to do when they see smoke from a fire or accident. The company is

00:04:35.600 --> 00:04:42.080
updating the system, the vehicles can handle emergency situations better after the update. Zooks is

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:48.220
the self-driving car company involved in the recall. Smoke can come from a fire or an accident scene.

00:04:48.840 --> 00:04:54.900
The details come from Engadget.com. Agility Robotics is starting a new place in California.

