The place is where people can learn how to work with their digit robots. The location sits right in

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:08.080
the same area as Tesla's main factory. This placement is in California near the factory. Robot

00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:14.460
companies are growing fast according to the report. The source is techcrunch.com and that's a wrap.

